
---
import "../styles/global.css";

interface Props {
    mostrarBotonInicio?: boolean;
}

const { mostrarBotonInicio = true } = Astro.props;
---

<section
    id="que-es"
    class="relative my-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-purple-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 via-white to-pink-50 px-6 py-16 shadow-sm md:px-12 lg:py-20"
>
    <!-- DECORACIÓN DE FONDO -->

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-pink-200/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-purple-200/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute right-16 top-12 text-4xl text-pink-200/70 select-none"
    >
        ✦
    </div>

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-10 left-10 text-5xl text-purple-200/60 select-none"
    >
        ♥
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl">

        <!-- BOTÓN VOLVER -->

        {mostrarBotonInicio && (
            <div class="mb-10">
                <a
                    href="/"
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-purple-700 shadow-md ring-1 ring-purple-100 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-x-1 hover:bg-purple-50 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-purple-200"
                >
                    <span class="text-lg">←</span>
                    Volver al inicio
                </a>
            </div>
        )}

        <!-- ENCABEZADO -->

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

            <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-pink-200 bg-pink-100 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-600 shadow-sm"
            >
                <span>✨</span>
                Conoce más sobre este espacio
            </span>

            <h2
                class="mt-5 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-800 md:text-5xl"
            >
                ¿De qué trata <br>
                <span
                    class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
                >
                     esta página?
                </span>
            </h2>

            <p
                class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base font-medium leading-8 text-slate-600 md:text-lg"
            >
                Este es un espacio seguro creado para informarte,
                acompañarte y recordarte que
                <span class="font-black text-purple-700">
                    tu cuerpo se respeta siempre.
                </span>
                Aquí podrás aprender a reconocer situaciones de riesgo,
                conocer tus derechos y descubrir dónde acudir si necesitas ayuda.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- TARJETAS -->

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">

            <!-- PROTECCIÓN -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.5rem] border border-purple-100 bg-white p-7 text-left shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >
                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    🛡️
                </div>

                <h3
                    class="mt-5 text-xl font-black text-slate-800"
                >
                    Tu protección
                </h3>

                <p
                    class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500"
                >
                    Conoce información clara y sencilla para entender
                    tus derechos y cuidar tu bienestar.
                </p>

                <div
                    class="mt-5 h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-purple-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>
            </article>


            <!-- APRENDER -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.5rem] border border-pink-100 bg-white p-7 text-left shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >
                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-pink-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    💡
                </div>

                <h3
                    class="mt-5 text-xl font-black text-slate-800"
                >
                    Aprende y detecta
                </h3>

                <p
                    class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500"
                >
                    Aprende a reconocer señales de alerta y a expresar
                    tus límites cuando algo no se siente bien.
                </p>

                <div
                    class="mt-5 h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-pink-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>
            </article>


            <!-- AYUDA -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.5rem] border border-amber-100 bg-white p-7 text-left shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >
                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    🤝
                </div>

                <h3
                    class="mt-5 text-xl font-black text-slate-800"
                >
                    No estás solo/a
                </h3>

                <p
                    class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500"
                >
                    Encuentra orientación y recursos para pedir ayuda
                    de manera segura, sin miedo y sin sentirte culpable.
                </p>

                <div
                    class="mt-5 h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-amber-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>
            </article>

        </div>


        <!-- LLAMADO A LA ACCIÓN -->

        <div
            class="mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.7rem] bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-500 p-8 text-center shadow-lg md:p-10"
        >

            <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">

                <div class="text-4xl">
                    💜
                </div>

                <h3
                    class="mt-4 text-2xl font-black text-white md:text-3xl"
                >
                    Tu voz es importante
                </h3>

                <p
                    class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/90 md:text-base"
                >
                    Si algo te preocupa, no tienes que enfrentarlo
                    en silencio. Aprende, pregunta y busca apoyo cuando
                    lo necesites.
                </p>

                <a
                    href="#pedir-ayuda"
                    class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-black text-purple-700 shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-purple-50 hover:shadow-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-white/50"
                >
                    Pedir ayuda ahora
                    <span class="text-lg">→</span>
                </a>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>

